    "bridal": {
      "type": "ptm-bridal",
      "settings": {
        "image_placeholder": "Photo slot: a real haldi ceremony, with family applying turmeric paste to the bride, with permission (no AI or stock imagery)",
        "heading": "The South Asian bride's turmeric, for her wedding glow",
        "subheading": "Haldi (HUL-dee): the Hindi word for turmeric",
        "text": "<p>A few days before a South Asian wedding, family and friends gather for the haldi ceremony. One by one, they smooth a paste of turmeric, often mixed with sandalwood and rosewater, onto the bride's face and arms. It's part blessing, part beauty ritual and always a party. The idea is simple: she should walk into her wedding glowing.</p><p>The tradition goes by many names. Bengali families call it gaye holud. Pakistani and North Indian Muslim families hold a mayun, with a turmeric paste called ubtan. In Tamil Nadu, the bride's bath on her wedding morning begins with turmeric. Across regions and faiths, the ingredient stays the same.</p><p>Our turmeric comes from Tamil Nadu. It's kasthuri manjal, a pale, fragrant wild turmeric that Tamil women have long used on their skin because it brightens without leaving a yellow stain.</p>",
        "glow_line": "Apply and leave on for just 12 minutes for the bridal glow.",
        "button_text": "See the SOUNDARYA bridal glow set",
        "button_url": "/pages/soundarya"
      }
    },
    "turmeric": {
      "type": "ptm-turmeric",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Wild turmeric",
        "lede": "Not the turmeric in your spice rack.",
        "text": "<p>We use a wild turmeric from Tamil Nadu, in southern India, known locally as kasthuri manjal. It's paler and more fragrant than the bright-yellow kitchen kind, and it's the one Indian women have long chosen for their skin, because it brightens without leaving a yellow tint.</p><p>In this mask, it helps even out the look of skin tone while three clays lift away excess oil and sandalwood keeps everything cool and calm.</p>",
        "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Turmeirc_18463052-bc95-4d90-b93d-c1204ed175e5.png",
        "caption_1": "The root",
        "image_1_placeholder": "Root photo slot",
        "caption_2": "The harvest (illustration)",
        "image_2_placeholder": "Harvest photo slot — upload the real supplier photo"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "spec_1": {
          "type": "spec",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Origin",
            "value": "Tamil Nadu, India"
          }
        },
        "spec_2": {
